*** HaatBazar ***


“HaatBazar digitizes traditional Bangladeshi marketplaces,
 enabling local vendors to reach a broader audience while providing 
 users with a convenient, affordable, and culturally familiar shopping experience.”


*** Meaning behind the name
    "Haat" --- traditional msrketplace (weekly/ local market)
    "Bazar" --- everyday market
    "HaatBazar" === Digital marketplace for everyone.

*** Core Idea: HaatBazar is a digital platform that brings traditional local markets online.
    It connects: 
    🧑‍🌾 Local sellers / small businesses
    🛍️ Everyday customers
    📦 Delivery & order system

*** Problem It Solves
    In Bangladesh:
    Many small sellers don’t have online presence
    Buyers struggle to find affordable local products
    No unified system for local + daily shopping
    
    HaatBazar solves this by creating:
    One platform for buying everything locally, easily, and online

*** Key Concept Features

    1️⃣ Local Marketplace Feel
    Like visiting a real bazar, but online
    Multiple sellers in one platform
    
    2️⃣ Product Categories
    Grocery 🥬
    Electronics 📱
    Clothing 👕
    Daily essentials 🧼

    3️⃣ Seller + Buyer System
    Sellers can list products
    Buyers can browse & purchase

    4️⃣ Shopping Cart + Orders
    Add to cart
    Checkout
    Track order

    5️⃣ Trust & Simplicity
    Simple UI (important for local users)
    Affordable focus (not luxury)


